# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
**/dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Build / test output
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
*.lcov
*.tsbuildinfo

# The repo-root .gitignore is the Visual Studio template, and its NuGet
# Package-Restore rule (`**/[Pp]ackages/*`) would otherwise swallow this
# workspace's packages/ directory whole — silently, so `git add` would just
# skip the component library. Re-include it here; rules above still apply
# inside it, so packages/components/dist and friends stay ignored.
!packages/*

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
